     A            MCCLID         5          COLHDG('CLAIMANT ID')
     A            MCCC      R               REFFLD(CODE)
     A                                      COLHDG('SECTION CODE')
     A            MCVAL     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('COVERAGE VALUE')
     A            MCLOC#         3  0       COLHDG('LOCATION NUMBER')
     A            MCPRM#         3  0       COLHDG('PREMISIS #')
